              <accid xml:id="m-8699fe25-4d46-4783-8400-770b4351d16a" facs="#m-53a1fbef-5355-497c-a50b-58d5579290ef" accid="f" /><syllable xml:id="m-6c39c8a0-7974-47e8-ad13-934dac966a41">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-59a18d8f-88c5-472b-a581-a75f92b26834" type="podatus" xml:id="m-7a4eeefd-20b4-48f3-ad5b-9a4935501a73">
                  <nc xml:id="m-3bd17ef0-81f0-47ce-a55d-f6e41ddf6b5e" pname="a" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-45d481b8-b766-42fb-82b4-70384d3707cc" pname="b" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-1127456b-60d5-47ac-ac92-f7ee8a877993">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-6bbbb938-2094-4fa4-b919-3d5873596fdb" type="punctum" xml:id="m-85b04ca4-c956-4f9d-b3e7-f4d4fde71849">
                  <nc xml:id="m-6f7106b2-8637-4a0e-a38c-62b416f901d2" pname="a" oct="3">
                    <signifLet xml:id="m-9ed5ac88-fdaa-4a9d-881e-567f41bdabe9" /></nc></neume></syllable><custos xml:id="m-1e89a7f1-af2f-4160-88bc-cfe473d759df" facs="#m-c33558b2-ee85-4b51-bcb4-3826ad2f8b2f" pname="a" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-c582f4ad-4f09-4161-9bc3-ddb599d15035"><lg xml:id="m-83229613-9577-49ae-bebd-9e23c7ea2b4f"><l xml:id="m-4e5c9566-34f5-4fe6-bd27-48c8943a91d0" facs="#m-c467dcca-5068-4d4d-84cc-72944f8ccffa" label="text-like">Our Lady, Mediatrix of all Graces.</l><l xml:id="m-8fc9caa2-4cb8-474d-a720-5c9fcfc7dc60" facs="#m-a98abc6e-d821-4e7c-98d6-a5a92cb20adb" label="text-like">For St. Angela Merici. Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-5dde63ad-3cd8-4a99-baa6-5a40ba11945f" facs="#m-05739869-4e1d-4fee-bc18-8179ca898713" label="lyrics-like">Ostia, Dómine, quam tibi beátae ] niam implóret, et grátiae tuae no¬</l><l xml:id="m-65ac356a-2449-4d35-ada7-ba3484f5b848" facs="#m-169b502c-29a7-47fe-9abc-0ca3a3d23447" label="lyrics-like">1t Angelae memóriam recoléntes</l><l xml:id="m-6448ed40-01cb-418c-befe-00dc782db9bd" facs="#m-1c893e30-b3f7-4742-8cbe-373e58b00aac" label="lyrics-like">bis dona conciliet (Per Dóminum.)</l><l xml:id="m-9e89e3bf-04af-433d-9633-6108b26da6aa" facs="#m-1163543a-203a-4992-9bca-db96c14a36a3" label="lyrics-like">offérimus, et nostrae pravitátis vé¬</l><l xml:id="m-bf8d5c77-7387-4761-ab4c-bf34d9f51641" facs="#m-ca19bc46-2fc3-4866-8f21-bab8bccd8017" label="text-like">For St. Petronilla. Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-b8f9bbf8-ff8c-45a7-b511-ccd93f6c78d5" facs="#m-a559839d-9dfd-4813-acb0-1a9852345641" label="lyrics-like">I Ccépta tibi sit, Dómine, sacrátae! de tribulatióne percepísse cognóscit</l><l xml:id="m-3228af4d-8926-4c94-8818-65a03d68989a" facs="#m-40b033d6-283b-4968-a1d7-cda2c81728b9" label="lyrics-like">A plebis oblátio pro tuórum ho-]auxilium. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-e1cd69eb-9fa1-430d-b9d6-1c58c0c4b9a5" facs="#m-eff6fe62-0f63-42ca-b5d9-ecba3f2af06a" label="lyrics-like">nóre Sanctórum: quorum se méritis</l><l xml:id="m-6edbbc42-9206-4108-9be9-1e09cd618990" facs="#m-449693ea-6223-4a9f-92c0-0930a6017b5f" label="lyrics-like">Preface of the B. V. M. Et te in festivitáte.</l><l xml:id="m-89b15ca9-3e54-4229-a40b-83e8d984a9f7" facs="#m-7d6cef84-d197-4b6c-9a1e-81dea6aee8d7" label="ambiguous">comm.6</l><l xml:id="m-06fe708b-8001-43d2-baa9-eb5c066cfe2b" facs="#m-8a211655-42e6-45ce-8915-227960c2605e" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-321f66ac-2581-402c-b1f0-e4ad97a08476" facs="#m-f46729a8-4bd6-4ef4-a898-64e71eb43f9b" label="lyrics-like">4 Alde mi-rábi-lis</l><l xml:id="m-26041928-b4d6-46ee-8fcb-9769a348dae4" facs="#m-b18f2574-8de8-4dbb-99df-7b95e077cd92" label="lyrics-like">es, "o Ma¬ rí- a, et fá¬</l><l xml:id="m-06ed65f4-83d6-403d-b804-9b6df59f6f5c" facs="#m-f5111b24-c038-4468-a166-77d771e52891" label="lyrics-like">plé-na est gra-ti- a- rum. T. P. Alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-f2bf9ba0-afad-4c61-886e-e78e11cbdff9" facs="#m-98c75ae3-501c-47a6-bfe3-fa0ee3d91b35" label="lyrics-like">ci-es tú¬ a</l><l xml:id="m-d0167bc1-82b9-448d-814d-485dc6627b5f" facs="#m-c613d1b8-8443-473f-9d86-33e6c3092496" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia.</l><l xml:id="m-66844b8d-6333-4553-9002-731c4c19ac57" facs="#m-0962daa5-30e1-4f27-a010-bcefef146a7a" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-a7e16dea-396e-4756-8848-3b7d6624ae43" facs="#m-e0127e78-bb10-463b-b2c6-18628590593c" label="lyrics-like">(Ubvéniat nobis, Dómine, beátae largiénte, ad redemptiónis aetérnae</l><l xml:id="m-fd26d430-41dd-442f-a1c0-d5488d146f6d" facs="#m-5936638c-ee6f-4ccc-a436-f7dda2eea8e2" label="ambiguous">O Mariae Matris tuae ac nostrae</l><l xml:id="m-97f5e74e-d762-4838-ba42-fa4aafe07da8" facs="#m-e8233b1a-2afe-40d9-be29-b1794663ba1d" label="lyrics-like">proficiámus augméntum: Qui vivis</l><l xml:id="m-2fd00bdb-ea5b-4a29-a315-9666a7e01bf1" facs="#m-a3fa4f6b-90fd-4bb1-a747-4fd50122bf49" label="lyrics-like">mediatrícis orátio: ut per haec sa¬</l><l xml:id="m-73c01b63-cbba-4162-9b4f-504642a24d3e" facs="#m-e3f257d9-e232-4ba9-967b-b4f357707963" label="ambiguous">et regnas.</l><l xml:id="m-7abebb85-5e58-4976-88f3-3f1b44c8a9f6" facs="#m-2de4b9ba-f7f9-4601-bdc9-2c96ad03e854" label="lyrics-like">crosáncta commércia, tua grátia</l><l xml:id="m-9d34b860-6b1e-4d58-9439-bfb94c643c56" facs="#m-3df85681-7711-4ae0-aec5-c5b9a88944a1" label="text-like">For St. Angela Merici. Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-8b73a654-27c9-49ab-9000-4252b3537207" facs="#m-d053b13e-1301-47b8-a452-0e319a277a45" label="lyrics-like">(VAelésti alimónia refécti, súppli-l exémplo, ab omni labe mundáti, et</l><l xml:id="m-87ed9def-1fc3-42ca-9bcc-25da5c8b048b" facs="#m-5c8c7fd1-208c-42f5-a017-f295a2770a2c" label="lyrics-like">córpore tibi placeámus, et mente.</l><l xml:id="m-0309b6c6-be99-43ed-967e-3fe61aa5df4b" facs="#m-47f0a5a9-9448-4a08-91c4-2db0a5dcf8a0" label="lyrics-like">Uces te, Dómine, deprecámur:</l><l xml:id="m-2f23a4f2-e327-48b8-ad8c-b5a295327bf5" facs="#m-d3da571f-439e-46ad-a7cd-50d7ffff9811" label="lyrics-like">ut beátae Angelae précibus et! (Per Dóminum.)</l><l xml:id="m-e816ff13-cca5-43af-a0f7-66a01ae38a24" facs="#m-a1c5e8c1-f608-4ad4-823a-d1c85867daa2" label="text-like">For St. Petronilla. Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-1e9fcf08-ee3e-4b70-8fcc-055abfc91b51" facs="#m-d3ce8442-efe4-4222-b8b3-b04ff933b29a" label="lyrics-like">CAtiásti, Dómine, familiam tuam ! réfove, cujus solémnia celebrámus.</l><l xml:id="m-2e560605-89e9-4410-a118-c6d37b9f3901" facs="#m-85250746-0c4c-4c39-bfb4-8c1fc9e1adec" label="lyrics-like">Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-3dba1424-f6ed-422c-8c27-516351da7151" facs="#m-62a55276-b36f-490f-b771-b562703ff018" label="lyrics-like">O munéribus sacris: ejus, quaé¬</l><l xml:id="m-dcac943a-8e9d-4d61-8c40-02863fe565b6" facs="#m-6c223428-8cf6-4e66-92b0-a07f4437861c" label="lyrics-like">sumus, semper interventióne nos</l><l xml:id="m-ce525e24-264a-4a52-99fe-f78d27bef226" facs="#m-d895504b-684a-49de-a3d3-d3c6bf94111f" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-5cc05508-474b-4bc1-9cd6-7f920fabbb1f" facs="#m-6b30edd5-1aaa-4faa-9187-c2b654dad804" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Benedícam te. p. 11.</l><l xml:id="m-b458fa31-b9ca-4331-af4c-e39ce856fc9c" facs="#m-af6dba3e-b258-4047-b71f-c5f29a8f9f6d" label="ambiguous">Is.55, 2-3.</l><l xml:id="m-d758b10a-0b75-4cab-9d72-a57a63bde7f1" facs="#m-7d76c2a2-6196-4875-8847-c00eaeee665e" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-3c23ed77-d6bd-464c-be43-81455c25cf83" facs="#m-9563fdcd-ccd1-4c20-920f-adcc6effca52" label="lyrics-like">Udite audiéntes me, et comédite] aurem vestram, et venite ad me</l><l xml:id="m-42c82a3e-89b1-4930-9b8b-f60aa56c54fe" facs="#m-6d9260a6-3fa3-4c50-90a7-01698ad5d942" label="lyrics-like">Il bonum, et delectábitur in cras-laudíte, et vivet ánima vestra.</l><l xml:id="m-14cf4507-ca69-406b-9df5-9ad786e44630" facs="#m-cd1cf62c-4289-4103-b857-d80aa9fa00b6" label="lyrics-like">sitúdine ánima vestra. Inclináte</l><l xml:id="m-50487c86-8071-4cfa-a5fd-724c43881a47" facs="#m-7a4735f0-a897-4ce6-b6f2-bbd36aede6ca" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-eddf0570-4637-49ca-8e8e-00a82caeb8b8" facs="#m-dfcca9d0-f53c-47e5-a636-a8f3731093fe" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-2eb6504b-bf7f-4f5f-8cfc-2167e152830c" facs="#m-3045fe11-d7f8-4bd2-bd72-3c8f9e2f78d2" label="lyrics-like">Ostras depreca-ti-ónes“ Ne despí-ci-as. V. In ne¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
